SCOPE
=====

This application currently supports only the 'continuous output'
mode of operation, where the output is a continuous current
specified by the user in milliAmps.


EXAMPLE APPLICATION
===================

To build the example application, uncomment the specified
lines in configure/RELEASE and the top level Makefile.
This has been configured to boot a vxWorks IOC with a
Hytec 8515 card in slot 5D.
